Package: infomax
Type: Package
Title: Infomax Independent Component Analysis
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Matt", "Craddock", email = "matt@mattcraddock.com", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Scott", "Makeig et al., SCCN/INC/UCSD", email = "scott@sccn.ucsd.ed", role = c("cph")))
Description: Implements Infomax and Extended Infomax Independent Component Analysis (ICA).
 A reimplementation of the mini-batch gradient descent algorithm found in 'EEGLAB'
 and 'MNE-Python', frequently used to perform ICA on electroencephalographic or
 magnetoencephalographic time-series.
